    <name>JTrac</name>
    <description>
        JTrac is a generic issue-tracking web-application that can be easily customized by adding custom fields 
        and drop-downs. Features include customizable workflow, field level permissions, e-mail integration, 
        file attachments, a detailed history view and an integrated wiki.
    </description>
